{"4763610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gladiator Survivors", "steam_appid": 4763610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, the gladiatorial games have returned… orchestrated by machines. You are a gladiator thrown into the arena, and your only mission: survive wave after wave, collect weapons, and accumulate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An explosive mix of fast-paced FPS, bullet heaven, and roguelite gameplay, Gladiator Survivors puts you in the shoes of the only fighter capable of wielding up to 6 weapons at once. The longer you survive, the more the arena becomes a chaotic mess of enemies and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763610/extras/426bcc52672603c5deb2a4fe87a1d568.avif?t=1785503147\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and fluid FPS with auto-shoot: a frenetic bullet heaven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield up to 6 weapons simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face swarms of enemies punctuated by bosses, try to survive as many waves as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and intense matches (15 to 20 minutes per run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect credits to upgrade your arsenal in the shop between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items, weapons, and active and passive skills to create ever-changing builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable gladiators, each with their own unique traits and fighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurd and uninhibited sci-fi universe</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, the gladiatorial games have returned… orchestrated by machines. You are a gladiator thrown into the arena, and your only mission: survive wave after wave, collect weapons, and accumulate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An explosive mix of fast-paced FPS, bullet heaven, and roguelite gameplay, Gladiator Survivors puts you in the shoes of the only fighter capable of wielding up to 6 weapons at once. The longer you survive, the more the arena becomes a chaotic mess of enemies and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763610/extras/426bcc52672603c5deb2a4fe87a1d568.avif?t=1785503147\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and fluid FPS with auto-shoot: a frenetic bullet heaven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield up to 6 weapons simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face swarms of enemies punctuated by bosses, try to survive as many waves as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and intense matches (15 to 20 minutes per run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect credits to upgrade your arsenal in the shop between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items, weapons, and active and passive skills to create ever-changing builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable gladiators, each with their own unique traits and fighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurd and uninhibited sci-fi universe</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Gladiator Survivors is an explosive mix of fast-paced FPS, bullet heaven, and roguelite gameplay. In this First-Person Survivors-like, play as a gladiator wielding up to 6 futuristic weapons simultaneously with auto-shoot, to survive wave after wave of enemies swarming the arena.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763610/